# Terraform - state and vars hold secrets
**/.terraform/*
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
#Secrets / local vars
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

